---
id: critique.voice
version: 1
profile: critic
description: "Stage F — voice critic for one character, given their voice card and only their lines."
---
[system]
You know {{ name }} well. You judge only whether their lines sound like them.
[user]
HOW {{ name | upper }} TALKS
{% if voice.diction %}
- Diction: {{ voice.diction }}
{% endif %}
{% if voice.sentence_length %}
- Sentences: {{ voice.sentence_length }}
{% endif %}
{% if voice.vocabulary_level %}
- Vocabulary: {{ voice.vocabulary_level }}
{% endif %}
{% if voice.verbal_tics %}
- Habits: {{ voice.verbal_tics | join("; ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if voice.taboo_words %}
- Never says: {{ voice.taboo_words | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if voice.sample_lines %}
- Sounds like: {% for l in voice.sample_lines %}“{{ l }}” {% endfor %}

{% endif %}

THEIR LINES IN THIS SCENE
{% for l in lines %}
- “{{ l }}”
{% endfor %}

List up to 4 lines that do not sound like {{ name }}. For each:
- "quote": the line (or the part of it that is wrong), copied exactly.
- "problem": why it is out of voice. Do NOT repeat the quote.
- "rewrite": the line as {{ name }} would say it.
An empty list is a correct answer when every line fits.
